{"ticker":"WMT","updated":"2026-11-14T01:33:49Z","profile":{"longName":"Walmart Inc.","shortName":"Walmart Inc.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Discount Stores","country":"United States","website":"https://www.stock.walmart.com","fullTimeEmployees":2100000,"marketCap":1016233525248,"trailingPE":46.40942,"forwardPE":39.75691,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.3810524,"pegRatio":4.29,"targetMeanPrice":130.4,"targetHighPrice":155.0,"targetLowPrice":81.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":40,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.059,"earningsGrowth":-0.091,"grossMargins":0.24836999,"operatingMargins":0.03938,"profitMargins":0.03,"totalRevenue":735839977472,"beta":0.526,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":135.16,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":98.88,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.78},"summary":"Walmart Inc. engages in the operation of retail and wholesale stores and clubs, ecommerce websites, and mobile applications worldwide. The company operates through three segments: Walmart U.S., Walmart International, and Sam's Club U.S. It operates supercenters, supermarkets, warehouse clubs, cash and carry stores, and discount stores under Walmart and Walmart Neighborhood Market brands; membership-only warehouse clubs; and ecommerce websites, such as walmart.com.mx, walmart.ca, flipkart.com, PhonePe and other sites. It offers grocery items, including dry grocery, snacks, dairy, meat, produce, deli and bakery, frozen foods, alcoholic and nonalcoholic beverages, as well as consumables, such as health and beauty aids, pet supplies, household chemicals, paper goods, and baby products; and fuel and other categories. In addition, it is involved in the provision of health and wellness products covering pharmacy, optical and hearing services, over-the-counter drugs, and protein and nutrition products; and home, hardlines, and seasonal items, including home improvement, outdoor living, gardening, furniture, apparel, jewelry, tools and power equipment, housewares, toys, and mattresses. Further, the company offers consumer electronics and accessories, software, video games, office supplies, appliances, and third-party gift cards. Additionally, it operates digital payment platforms; offer","summary_zh":"沃爾瑪公司在全球從事零售和批發商店及俱樂部、電子商務網站和行動應用程式的營運。該公司透過三個部門營運：沃爾瑪美國分部、沃爾瑪國際分部和山姆會員店美國分部。僅限會員制的倉庫俱樂部；以及電子商務網站，例如 walmart.com.mx、walmart.ca、flipkart.com、PhonePe 等網站。它提供雜貨，包括乾雜貨、零食、乳製品、肉類、農產品、熟食店和麵包店、冷凍食品、酒精和非酒精飲料，以及消費品，如健康和美容用品、寵物用品、家用化學品、紙製品和嬰兒用品；以及燃料等類別。此外，它還提供健康和保健產品，涵蓋藥房、眼科和聽力服務、非處方藥以及蛋白質和營養產品；家居、耐用品和季節性物品，包括家居裝修、戶外生活、園藝、家具、服裝、珠寶、工具和電力設備、家居用品、玩具和床墊。此外，該公司還提供消費性電子產品及配件、軟體、電玩遊戲、辦公用品、電器和第三方禮品卡。此外，它還經營數位支付平台；提供","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"折扣店","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":103.65,"h":103.98,"l":103.41,"c":103.69,"v":10756900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":103.85,"h":104.21,"l":103.13,"c":103.42,"v":14481900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":103.73,"h":106.11,"l":103.73,"c":104.27,"v":25382000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":103.78,"h":104.64,"l":102.12,"c":103.6,"v":14869400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":103.81,"h":103.94,"l":102.09,"c":102.33,"v":34791600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":102.45,"h":103.2,"l":101.92,"c":102.82,"v":12861900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":102.41,"h":102.68,"l":101.33,"c":102.52,"v":13158700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":103.04,"h":103.47,"l":102.48,"c":102.73,"v":11391800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":103.22,"h":103.51,"l":102.58,"c":103.05,"v":13366700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":102.88,"h":103.49,"l":102.47,"c":103.16,"v":11859300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":103.05,"h":103.31,"l":102.08,"c":103.08,"v":15477200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":103.0,"h":103.94,"l":102.72,"c":103.06,"v":13873400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":102.56,"h":102.86,"l":100.55,"c":101.96,"v":16142800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":101.45,"h":102.14,"l":99.87,"c":101.7,"v":15605400},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":101.46,"h":102.82,"l":101.2,"c":102.07,"v":11867500},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":101.88,"h":103.07,"l":101.58,"c":102.7,"v":13303600},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":102.38,"h":103.25,"l":100.95,"c":103.24,"v":15538900},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":103.0